  "short_description": "體驗前所未有的閾限空間恐怖。受“後室”（The Backrooms）啟發，《FailRooms》將你困在一個由荒誕建築、破碎空間和本不該存在的物體組成的無盡世界中。趁還能笑得出來，盡情笑吧。你能逃離這個從一開始就沒打算講邏輯的地方嗎？",
  "short_description_en": "Experience liminal horror like never before. Inspired by the Backrooms, FailRooms traps you in an endless world of absurd architecture, broken spaces, and things that should never have been built. Laugh while you can. Can you escape a place that was never designed to make sense?",
